    18	
    19	1. **Whether the ladder reproduces** under their own model and decoding settings (§3).
    20	2. **What each runtime actually costs** when you count money rather than tokens (§4).
    21	3. **What explicit state protects against**, through two probes aimed at the
    22	   limitations the paper itself declares but does not measure (§5).
